      "releaseNotes": "New\n• Readiness: See a daily score from your sleep, HRV and resting heart rate. It also tells you if today is a day to train or a day to rest.\n• Friend Groups: Make groups with friends and run challenges with start and end dates. You can repeat a challenge, join monthly boards and see suggested groups for your gym.\n• New feed: Workout cards now show photos, records, highlights and your Strength Score. Comments post at once.\n• New Progress tab: It has sections for Workouts, Body and Achievements, a streak card with weekly rings, and muscle activity rings.\n• New Strength Score screen: A muscle \"flower\" shows your score. You can also see each score increase on the workout that caused it, and which lifts to repeat to keep your score.\n• Garmin Connect: Connect your Garmin account t o import your activities.\n• Import from Apple Health: Select and import more than one outside workout at the same time.\n• Apple Watch: Log distance + weight exercises, such as farmer's carries.\n• Live Activity: The workout timer now shows in the Dynamic Island.\n• New look: Liquid Glass buttons and a softer dark theme.\n\nImprovements and fixes\n• Warm-up sets stay lighter than your working sets. Pyramid sets keep their weights in order.\n• Machine and plate weights round correctly. The plate calculator now goes up to 1000 lb.\n• Better rest timer sync between your iPhone and Apple Watch.\n• More accurate calories in Apple Health for cardio and phone-started workouts.\n• Cardio-only workouts no longer count toward your streak by mistake.\n• When you change your split on one device, your other devices now get the change.\n• Smaller download size and faster app start.\n• Many small fixes, including dark mode.",
